      "instance_name": "wedding_kiss",
      "label": "Two women in wedding attire kissing affectionately",
      "description": "The scene depicts two women, both dressed in white wedding dresses and veils, embracing and kissing tenderly. Their hair is styled in loose waves, and their expressions convey intimacy and celebration. The setting appears to be a formal event, likely a wedding, with soft lighting and decorative elements in the background. The women are positioned centrally, facing each other, with their arms wrapped around one another. The scene is emotionally warm and celebratory.",
